Explanation: WeOS 优先级策略 —— 默认稳定版，UKUI 定点提升到 testing
Package: *
Pin: release n=@DEBIAN_SUITE@
Pin-Priority: 990

Package: *
Pin: release n=@DEBIAN_SUITE@-security
Pin-Priority: 990

Package: *
Pin: release n=@DEBIAN_SUITE@-updates
Pin-Priority: 990

Package: *
Pin: release n=@DEBIAN_SUITE@-backports
Pin-Priority: 500

Explanation: 第三方仓库不得覆盖 Debian 官方包
Package: *
Pin: origin deb.xanmod.org
Pin-Priority: 600

Package: *
Pin: origin dl.winehq.org
Pin-Priority: 600

Explanation: 低优先级兜底，仅在 trixie 无法满足依赖时从 forky 取包
Package: *
Pin: release n=@UKUI_SUITE@
Pin-Priority: 100

Explanation: UKUI 4.20 及其运行时依赖强制从 forky 取
Package: ukui-*
Pin: release n=@UKUI_SUITE@
Pin-Priority: 900

Package: peony*
Pin: release n=@UKUI_SUITE@
Pin-Priority: 900

Package: ukwm*
Pin: release n=@UKUI_SUITE@
Pin-Priority: 900

Package: libpeony*
Pin: release n=@UKUI_SUITE@
Pin-Priority: 900
